```css
.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 18rem), 1fr));
  gap: 1.5rem;
}

.page {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 18rem;
  grid-template-areas:
    "header header"
    "main   aside"
    "footer footer";
}
.page > header { grid-area: header; }
.page > main   { grid-area: main; }
```

| Piece | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `fr`. | share of leftover space (after fixed tracks and content minimums). |
| `minmax(18rem, 1fr)`. | at least 18rem, grow to share space. |
| `min(100%, 18rem)`. | never wider than the container on tiny screens. |
| `repeat(auto-fit, …)`. | as many columns as fit. |
| `grid-column: 1 / -1`. | span from the first line to the last. |

